---
title: gas_consumption (EIP-7951)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_charge : charge 6900 gas
    q_charge --> q_execute : gas available
    q_charge --> q_oog : insufficient gas
    q_execute --> q_result : execute P256VERIFY
    q_result --> [*] : return result (no revert)
    q_oog --> [*] : out of gas

    note right of q_charge
        INV-019: Gas cost is 6900 (differs from RIP-7212 cost of 3450)
        INV-020: Precompile MUST NOT revert under any circumstances
        INV-021: Gas is consumed even on invalid inputs or verification failure
    end note
